# Expansion-time error shows "in expansion of" provenance.
# The macro transformer tries to access a nonexistent argument index.
[defmacro broken [fn [macro-args]
  [type: "var"  name: [get 5 macro-args]]
]]

[broken 1]
=== error
[E001] key not found

=== warn
